   696	    # The control above varies ONE governed marker at a time, so it never
   697	    # exercises the dangerous shape: all five absent AND an unrelated
   698	    # description. That row is a real markerless spawn (a hook that failed
   699	    # open admits exactly this), and the filter used to erase it from the
   700	    # denominator — hiding the very gap the ratio renders.
   701	    # ------------------------------------------------------------------
