   741	        DIFFERENT bytes was truncated, redacted or forged — either way it is
   742	        not the short, secret-free probe line, so it counts."""
   743	        # t8 P2: assert the LIVE detector, not the always-False exemption
   744	        # wrapper — through the wrapper these negatives pass vacuously even
