   FILE:LINE: `scripts/_framework_manifest_set.sh:976`, `scripts/_framework_manifest_set.sh:991`, `scripts/_framework_manifest_set.sh:1008`, `CHANGELOG.md:179`, `.claude/scripts/local/release.sh:103`  
   Concrete failure scenario: the apply path now checks effective Git behavior, but its advertised dry-run twin checks only exact text. With:
   ```gitignore
   /settings.local.json
